      "message": "fix(ui): set the Windows taskbar icon, not only the title-bar icon\n\nwinit 0.30 sets only ICON_SMALL from with_window_icon on Windows. The\ntaskbar button and Alt+Tab use ICON_BIG, set by with_taskbar_icon. The\nshell now sets both, from the 256 px logotype render.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nFixes #1754",
